<p>This notice explains how Mustafa Anıl Aşlakcı, the data controller, handles personal data under Türkiye’s Law No. 6698 (KVKK). Email: <a href="mailto:{{ siteFeatures['site-contact'].controllerAddress | escape }}">{{ siteFeatures['site-contact'].controllerAddress | escape }}</a>.</p>
<h2>Collection, purposes and legal grounds</h2>
<ul><li>When you load the site, the host receives connection and request data to deliver and protect the service. This serves the controller’s legitimate interest under Article 5(2)(f), subject to your rights.</li><li>When you contact me by email or LinkedIn, you share contact details and a message electronically. I use them to respond or take steps towards an agreement where relevant (Article 5(2)(c)), or to handle correspondence under legitimate interests (Article 5(2)(f)).</li><li>Optional GA4 uses browser identifiers, page views and interaction events for site measurement, based on your consent under Article 5(1). The browser stores the preference for 180 days of validity. Analytics retention depends on property settings.</li></ul>
<h2>Recipients and retention</h2>
<p>GitHub Pages and its delivery network serve the site. Gmail and LinkedIn deliver correspondence sent through their respective services. Google receives measurement data when you allow analytics. Services may process data outside Türkiye. Correspondence is kept for the time required to handle the request and meet applicable obligations.</p>
<h2>Your rights and how to apply</h2>
<p>Under Article 11 you may ask whether your data is processed, request details, check its use, learn who received it in Türkiye or abroad, request correction or deletion where applicable and ask that recipients be notified. You may object to an adverse result reached solely by automated analysis and seek compensation for harm caused by unlawful processing.</p>
<p>Send your request to <a href="mailto:{{ siteFeatures['site-contact'].applicationEmail | escape }}">{{ siteFeatures['site-contact'].applicationEmail | escape }}</a>. State which right you are exercising and include contact details so I can respond. See the <a href="https://www.kvkk.gov.tr/Icerik/2033/Aydinlatma-Yukumlulugu-">Personal Data Protection Authority’s guidance</a> and the <a href="/en/cookie-policy/">cookie policy</a>.</p>
